    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feels like i'm just being paranoid now cuz im fine. if it was something serious like a stroke wouldn't it still be happening? im thinking maybe i'll just take a couple of aspirin and see how i feel in the morning. that's fine right? just to be safe?",
